{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","达米安"],["/names/en","Damian"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名聪明的辅助，使用发明的小玩具，为友军提供治疗并干扰敌人的攻击。"],["/description_i18n/en","An intelligent Support hero who uses all sorts of inventions and gizmos to heal allies and disrupt enemy attacks."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","看看我的新发明吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Check out my latest invention!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","又有好点子了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Yet another stroke of genius!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","看我的，伟大战车！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Behold my majestic chariot."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","回去改进一下！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Retreat... and... revise."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","哼哼，这次的想法很成功吧？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Hmh. It's such a great idea isn't it?"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我想到了新主意，马上制造！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","I just had a great idea for a new contraption!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","不不不不不不不不不！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ha- Hoo- Heh- Hatchoo!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","自然的魔法。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Nature's magic- hah? Uh oh. Uh... woah! Sorry I'm just... not sure."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","我干点什么好呢？对了，完美。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","*Yawn* What can I do... Hm... Got it! Mhm. Yep, perfect! I'm so good."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇！！这可是稀罕的好东西，我正需要呢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow! A rare find, and just what I needed!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","唔，可以拿来做什么呢……我得好好想想！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Hmm... how will I put this to use? I know it'll come in handy!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","丛林妙想家"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Woody Wonder"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","五光十色的异想是他的翅膀，也是勋章。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Each brilliant idea is a wing, each invention a medal in his storybook world."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","缤纷奇想"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Storybook Spark"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","总有一天，小小少年会战胜所有怪物，然后将幻想称作奇迹。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","A young heart marches on, believing every fantasy can become a miracle."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Velvet Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我发明了新开门机关！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Check out this new little gizmo I made!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","改良下这张桌子吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I'll modify this table!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哦哦哦！气泡水！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow, it's soda!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我给这盏灯加了开关！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I added a switch to this light!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","会收到什么礼物呢？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What gifts will I get this year?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我也做了怪兽模型！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I crafted some monster models!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","走，去放烟花！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I can definitely tweak these lanterns to be brighter."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说，达米安是有史以来被达赫妮婆婆管教过次数最多的孩子，而且至今没有改善迹象。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","They say that in all of Granny Dahnie's years, no child has ever been disciplined more times by her than Damian. Unfortunately, his behavior has yet to improve much."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","达米安的木雕滑行器第一次试飞时，被莱卡误认为是信鸽，莱卡还拿了投喂用的谷物和坚果。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","When Damian's wooden glider flew for the first time, Lyca mistook it for a carrier pigeon and brought it nuts to eat."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","达米安的身上常有实验造成的伤口和淤青，是草药园园主的常客。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Damian is usually covered in cuts and bruises from his experiments. As a result, he is one of the healing herbalist's most frequent visitors."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","达米安私下里会为自己的每一种发明起一个拉风的名字，除了他自己没人能完整念出来。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Damian secretly comes up with flashy nicknames for all of his inventions, which he only remembers."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","达米安为科林制造的义肢学名为：苍翠的森林霸主之伟躯。科林目前还不知道这个名字。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","The scientific name of the prosthetic limbs given to Korin by Damian is \"Arms of the Wood Warden\". Korin, however, is completely oblivious to its name."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","月湖村的居民们总是能看见达米安仓皇逃窜的身影，紧随其后的一般是那些被他的发明惹怒的小动物。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","The residents of Lunadorf are accustomed to seeing mobs of angry forest critters chasing after Damian, disgruntled by his newest inventions."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","达米安曾经帮助达赫妮婆婆修好陪伴她三十余年的伞杖，可能这是她最后总是对达米安网开一面的原因。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Damian often helps Granny Dahnie repair her decades-old umbrella weapon, which may be the reason why she tolerates his shenanigans so much."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据达米安说，他曾经发明出一个不需要任何能源也能够自我驱动的巨大木偶，但是没人真正见过。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Damian claims that he once invented a massive, autonomous wooden golem that required no energy source to move. To this day, nobody has seen it for themselves."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","“我真的做出来了！但就在揭幕给大家的前一天，木偶在月光下自己动了起来，一路走出了村子！”达米安对巨大人偶的去向如此申辩。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","\"I really made it, I swear! But the night before I unveiled it to everyone, that crazy golem got up and walked right out of the village!\"—Damian's response when asked about the golem's whereabouts."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","达米安不知道自己已经成了薄暮丛林中的名人，同时上了莱卡和帕瑞莎——薄暮巡游队和荆棘卫队的重点盯防名单。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Damian has no idea that he has become something of a celebrity in the Dark Forest. Not only that, he is also being closely watched by the Dusk Patrollers and the Thorned Guards, namely Lyca and Parisa."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","啊哟！又撞到头了……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Ouch! Hit my head again..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415016.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415016.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","伊温 & 达米安"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hewynn & Damian"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","经过上次的事件，我感觉，藤蔓这种材质在制作义肢时存在着一些天然的不足！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","After the last incident, I think vines are naturally deficient as components for prosthetics!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415025.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415025.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","达米安 & 科林"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Damian & Korin"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我发明了新开门机关！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Check out this new little gizmo I made!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415116.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415116.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","哦哦哦！气泡水！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Wow, it's soda!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415117.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415117.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","我给这盏灯加了开关！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","I added a switch to this light!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415425.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415425.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","会收到什么礼物呢？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","What gifts will I get this year?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415426.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415426.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我也做了怪兽模型！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","I crafted some monster models!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415599.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415599.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","走，去放烟花！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","I can definitely tweak these lanterns to be brighter."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415600.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415600.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","达米安"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Damian"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","要是问我和达米安的相遇……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","How Damian and I met..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412020.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412020.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","科林 & 达米安"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Korin & Damian"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，达米安，我离开丛林都三年了，你肯定做出来不少好东西吧？"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Hey, Damian! I bet you've created a ton of cool stuff in the past three years while I was away."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 达米安 & 达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Damian & Granny Dahnie"]]}